=== J2: Experiment lifecycle ===
--- J2 bullet mapping ---
b1 hypothesis/question: 1
b2 method/data: method=1, data_provenance=1
b3 reproducibility: schema does not have a dedicated reproducibility field
b4 results: 1
b5 interpretation: no dedicated interpretation field (conclusion/result serve this)
b6 decision influence: via relations (derived_from, influences, affects)
b7 production merge prohibited: production_merge_allowed=production_merge_allowed: false

